{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-community-jvt","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-community-jvt-aqua-jumeirah-village-triangle","about":"The Community is a new residential complex of the developer Aqua Properties in Dubai's Jumeirah Village Triangle (JVT) . The project will feature studios, 1 and 2-room apartments. The community introduces a new concept of coliving that is gaining popularity among millennials, young professionals and entrepreneurs around the world.The community encourages interaction between residents and provides a sense of belonging, creating a sense of family, with less financial outlay. Residents of the Community live in their own furnished apartments with a bedroom, living room, kitchen and bathroom. However, other living spaces such as public living rooms, library, game center, laundry and other amenities will be shared. This concept allows residents with common interests to spend time together outside of work and achieve professional and personal growth through communication, forming new friendships, supporting each other and creating new business connections. Community spaces set a new standard for comfort. The apartments are finished with high-quality materials and household appliances of European brands and equipped with designer furniture. The walls and floors are lined with full-bodied porcelain tiles of the famous Spanish brand Living Ceramic. Sanitaryware and tableware from another Spanish brand, International Water &amp; Wellness. The apartments are equipped with kitchen appliances of world brands.","price":550000,"title":"The Community JVT","bitrix":{"id":522,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Community JVT","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Community JVT","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Aqua Properties","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle (JVT)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.clo